        <mxCell id="yZM8KfAOPEB3S9nS4MOV-353" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="4. Booking" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="-30" y="980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yZM8KfAOPEB3S9nS4MOV-355" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="1. Users &amp; Auth:&#xa;&#xa;POST: /api/v1/auth/signup&#xa;POST: /api/v1/auth/login&#xa;GET: /api/v1/users/profile [User profile &amp; booking history]&#xa;&#xa;2. Discovery (Events &amp; Shows):&#xa;&#xa;GET: /api/v1/events [Search with filters: title, city, date]&#xa;GET: /api/v1/events/{event_id} [Comprehensive event details &amp; metadata]&#xa;GET: /api/v1/events/{event_id}/shows [List of shows for a specific event]&#xa;GET: /api/v1/shows/{show_id}/seats [Real-time seat availability map]&#xa;&#xa;3. Booking &amp; Transactions: &#xa;&#xa;POST: /api/v1/bookings/reserve [Temporary lock on seats for 5-10 mins]&#xa;POST: /api/v1/bookings/confirm [Finalize booking after payment]&#xa;GET: /api/v1/bookings/{booking_id} [Check booking status/get e-ticket]&#xa;DELETE: /api/v1/bookings/{booking_id} [Cancel booking/release seats]&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="320" width="610" x="-55" y="1280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yZM8KfAOPEB3S9nS4MOV-403" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;5. SCHEMA DESIGN&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="250" x="20" y="1630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yZM8KfAOPEB3S9nS4MOV-407" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Text" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="280" y="2520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yZM8KfAOPEB3S9nS4MOV-408" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;1. Users Table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;user_id (UUID, PK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;name, email, password_hash&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;created_at (Timestamp)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Events Table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;event_id (UUID, PK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;title (Varchar, Indexed)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;description (Text)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;metadata (JSONB) [Stores: cast, duration, language, ratings]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Show_Seats Table (The Transactional Table)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;show_seat_id (UUID, PK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;show_id (FK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;seat_number (Varchar)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;status (Enum: Available, Locked, Booked)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;price (Decimal)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;version (Int) [For Optimistic Locking]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Bookings Table&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;booking_id (UUID, PK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;user_id (FK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;show_id (FK)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;status (Enum: Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;booking_time (Timestamp)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="890" x="-250" y="1910" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
